[1m[38;5;231mWhat shape should the stored preferences take?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mFixed set + defaults (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mDeclared keys (username, rememberMe, theme) each with a default and a validator. Unknown keys rejected.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Generic key/value store
     [38;5;246mOpen get/set/remove over any key. Maximum flexibility, no defaults or typo protection.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Fixed set, no theme
     [38;5;246mJust the login-related prefs (username, rememberMe). Smallest possible scope.[39m
  [38;5;246m4. Type something.[39m
